# `output/` holds two kinds of thing:
#
#   committed  episode-01.mp3, preview.gif   — GitHub Pages serves these
#   ignored    *.mp4 *.webm *.mov *.wav      — long masters and raw takes
#
# The ignore rules live in ../../.gitignore and ../.gitignore, which also carry
# the `!` negations that keep the two committed files tracked. Nothing to
# configure here; this file only explains the split.
